<title>SWEDEN: Reuters' tenth ex-Stockholm air cargo report.</title>
<headline>Reuters' tenth ex-Stockholm air cargo report.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the currency average ex-Stockholm air cargo market rates per kg in Swedish crowns for a 100 kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one:</p>
<p>			  July 14     May 16</p>
<p>			  UNITED STATES</p>
<p> STO-NYC		 9.98     10.10</p>
<p> STO-CHI		10.63     11.40</p>
<p> STO-LAX		11.76     13.00</p>
<p>			  ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p> STO-HKG		12.91     13.60</p>
<p> STO-SIN		12.88     13.60</p>
<p> STO-PEK		14.10	 -</p>
<p> STO-SHA		15.63	 -</p>
<p> STO-TYO		18.75     19.90</p>
<p> STO-BKK		12.86     13.20</p>
<p>			   MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> STO-DXB		10.02     10.10</p>
<p>			    AFRICA</p>
<p> STO-JNB		18.75     20.10</p>
<p>			   EUROPE</p>
<p> STO-LON		 7.08	7.45</p>
<p> STO-PAR		 7.25	7.25</p>
<p>			   LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p> STO-MEX		16.38	 -</p>
<p> STO-SAO		21.25     20.70</p>
<p> STO-BUE		25.75	 -</p>
<p> STO-SCL		24.05	 -</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Stockholm's international Arlanda airport.</p>
<p>*All prices quoted in Swedish crowns.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative or current market activity. -- Air Cargo newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
